From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 10:52:34 +0200
Subject: add LAVABMS

This adds a new MB for TQMA93XX.

Signed-off-by: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
---
 arch/arm/dts/Makefile                            |   3 +-
 arch/arm/dts/imx93-tqma9352-lava-bms-u-boot.dtsi |  62 ++
 arch/arm/dts/imx93-tqma9352-lava-bms.dts         | 344 ++++++++++
 board/tq/tqma93xx/Kconfig                        |   9 +
 board/tq/tqma93xx/MAINTAINERS                    |   2 +
 board/tq/tqma93xx/Makefile                       |   1 +
 board/tq/tqma93xx/tqma93xx-lavabms.c             | 147 ++++
 configs/tqma93xx_lavabms_defconfig               | 151 ++++
 doc/board/tq/tqma93xx.rst                        |   4 +
 include/configs/tqma93xx-lavabms.h               |  24 +
 include/configs/tqma93xx.h                       |   2 +
 11 files changed, 748 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

